Z||000004||FieroLisa||05-21-2001||11:02 PM||||Are you people nuts? 84Bill I hope your kidding, I talked to you at the show and you seemed like a really nice guy!<P>People deserved it more than me? Cause I didn't send my car away to be painted and lowered and worked on? <P>I sat on my butt and sanded that thing myself! Because I took apart my interior and painted it myself! Because I took it upon myself to try to learn how to lower it myself, and participate in that! <P>That trophy I got meant a hell of a lot to me, because that car is MY creation, Im proud of it, I love to drive it. Trophies arent everything, I enjoy my car and I deserved that trophy! I can say I did most of the work to that car myself, without having much prior knowledge just a lot of ambition and a lot of good advice.<P>Once again Bill, I hope your kidding.<P>Yah it sucks that I pre-registered for last year and didnt get judged or get my money back. Doesn't mean I dont appreciate what I have now. ||||reg||1
