Z||000013||northstar87||05-21-2001||11:22 PM||||I have to give my 2 cents also.  Lisa has worked very hard on her car and deserves her award.  She was so happy after she won.  I really think that you owe her an apology for making this a bigger deal than what it really is.  If you did not win this one, there is always another show.   By the way, a trophy is not everything.  I have come home many times without an award.  I just really enjoy talking to the people that also love Fiero's.  If I win an award, it is just a cherry on top of my ice cream.  So why are you making such a fuss?  Just get over it and try again at the next show.  No hard feelings.<P>Chris ||||reg||1
Z||000014||84Bill||05-21-2001||11:24 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by V8Fiero:<BR><B>Lisa: I think 84Bill was saying that you didnt appreciate the trophy that you got and what it stood for!<P>When I used to be into mini trucks I attended a many of shows and it didnt matter if I placed or not. I just really enjoyed the people and all the nice vehicles. I think that is the most important element.<P>The trophies and such are just an extra bonus.<P>Just an innocent bystanders perception.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Scott</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thank you<BR>That is exactly what I ment It just seamed to me lisa that by saying you paid for that "Stinkin Trophy" ment that it ment nothing to you and all those others that woked hard for it get to see you say in it STINKS ha! that is really nice of you to win a popularity contest and spit on the loosers.<BR>Your comment burns at me even thow I was not in that class, thank GOD for that cuz I'd really be pissed and people would think I were mad because I lost. Anyway Your choice of words no matter how inocent you thought smacks of an indignantcy and arrogence. Some one once said to the starving masses "Let them eat cake"  <P>I appologize to you Lisa about my comment on your car I know what it takes to get it where you have. I only ask that you appologize to those you hurt by that comment on the "Stinkin Trophy" You have ticked off a lot of people even thow they don't say it.<BR>||||reg||8
Z||000015||grinthock||05-21-2001||11:25 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B>grinthock what the hell do you have against me?????<P>Look people I have had a bad day: My car got broken into and because you people didnt understand my inflection over the internet you all are flipping out and calling me a bad person?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>What do I have against you?  You seem to think you are the BIG GIRL, do all the work yourself (which I admire by the way), and expect everyone to put you up on a pedestal because you seem to think you are the hottest thing since sliced bread in the fiero industry.  Look at your signature line occsionally?  You with barely any clothes on, ontop of your car? WHAT KIND of image are you trying to put forward here?  THIS is the kind of response you get when you act that way.  **I** have heard ENOUGH stories for the ENTIRE list that I won't mention here.   <P>If you wanna play with the big boyz, stop being a spoiled little rich brat.<BR>||||reg||1
