Z||000019||SLICKRICK||05-21-2001||11:32 PM||||Hey all im with northstart on this one...i had fun going to the show...just being around people who have a love of fieros....its not really about the winning...of course thats nice...but its the comrodery that u have there.. not the actual competitivness that should rule the afterthoughts of the show....i met lisa and also saw how much she was into her car and really pleasantly caught me off guard as to how knowledgeable she was about it...personally im elated for her....i mean the trophy is truly a plus...no doubt about that...but there will always be other shows too...heck i didn't think i would even get my car noticed among all the people who had nicer cars...but i had some encouraging comments and i was happy for that..i didn't need a trophy....so i think we all need to chill and be happy with our lil cans of free speed wax and window cleaner...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||12
