Z||000023||sjp777||05-21-2001||11:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by grinthock:<BR><B> <BR>What do I have against you?  You seem to think you are the BIG GIRL, do all the work yourself (which I admire by the way), and expect everyone to put you up on a pedestal because you seem to think you are the hottest thing since sliced bread in the fiero industry.  Look at your signature line occsionally?  You with barely any clothes on, ontop of your car? WHAT KIND of image are you trying to put forward here?  THIS is the kind of response you get when you act that way.  **I** have heard ENOUGH stories for the ENTIRE list that I won't mention here.   <P>If you wanna play with the big boyz, stop being a spoiled little rich brat.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Damn, even the Canadians are kickin her butt over this one. Call out the national guard.<P>This is getting way out of hand. So she said stinkin trophy. Big whoop-ass deal. I use that adjective about a lot of things, including my car if the mood strikes. Doesn't mean I don't appreciate it, and her beaming smile in the pictures with her trophy don't look forced to me.<P>I agree she gets a bit of special treatment here (the usual 35 replies within an hour of any of her posts) but she is one of the only girls in here and we're a bunch of sweaty greasy guys who spend too much time under our cars We need more girls.<P>And Grinthock: if you think the photo in her sig is revealing, then you're hanging out in the wrong places buddy. You need to get out more.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_2.jpg">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||1
