Z||000028||84Bill||05-21-2001||11:51 PM||||This will hopefully be my last post on this issue<P>Lisa I'm not at all jeallouse of your prize nor anyone else. I speak for those that competed against you and lost and the prize has meaning to them, then saw your post that demeans the prize as stinking, That is all. Again I apollogize for my comment on your seat covers. <BR>Your car is a show car and deserves whatever it gets but remember that you are a respected member of the Fiero community and with that comes a responsibility for how you handel yourself and what you say. What you said was not right in any context! <BR>There is always a next time and someone else will win and you will not and should that person do as you did then I will unleash my vengence with extreme prejudice on them. <BR>If it means anything the next time we meet I will appologize in person. Because thats just how I am Believe me I dont like making an as$ of myself. <BR>Thank you for your understanding <P>An yes Grint you were way off line there that was really uncalled for this is not a Lisa bashing session and I never intended it to be and now you have made me regret starting this thread! I should has just sent her an email now I have to appologize for you too! If your going to make comments like that then do it yourself or keep it to yourself. I happen to have quite a lot of respect for her and her efforts. Damn! welcome to the Nuclear age kiddies!<p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 05-22-2001).]||||reg||1
