Z||000036||RobertVol||05-22-2001||12:12 AM||||Well hmmm another "Strange" post on the forum....I seem to see more of these starting all the time. Oh well.<P>Let me just say that These awards at the shows to me are a joke anyway. I went to Daytona and saw cars when that to me, were no where close to others that should have won but did not. <P>But something to consider - <P>1. If Lisa won because her car was better and she deserved it because of all the work she put into the car, then great! and if she did win for this reason then she can say whatever the he!! she wants. This is an public Forum. I mean are we really talking about a huge award??? I have been to shows. I dont think if you dont win its that big of a loss. They dont have the best judges in the world. IF that pisses someone off...hmm I don't think I will lose sleep over it.<P>2. If she won because she seems to be an attractive girl and she like Fieros and some judges liked that...again who cares! We should all be into our cars not this stupid feeling that these awards mean anything really. IF you have a great car in great shape then great! but the award to me is trivial. <P>You can say "well, it shows how much work I put into my car" <P>And I would say "I dont need someone to tell me how much work I put into my car" I can tell everytime I get into and start the motor.<P>Lisa ......I dont know why or how you won. But if you did...Congrats and say whatever you want. Its your award. You can put in the garbage if you want. <P>1 - Lisa has been nothing but nice on the Forum<BR>2- She like Fieros<BR>3 - And she likes her picture on the Forum Signature...uh and this is a Bad thing? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Now I may tick some people off with this but again this is a PUBLIC forum and this may start a flame war but uh I Really dont care<P>&lt;---Screw a flame suit! Flame away<P>hmm Will I really care? he I dont think so. <P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT 56k T TOP  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club<P>CLICK BELOW AND SEE OUR SITE !!! <BR>NEXT MEETING - May 26th, in Jacksonville<BR><A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=819451&a=5959473&p=36934984&Sequence=1"> ||||reg||13
Z||000037||SLICKRICK||05-22-2001||12:21 AM||||and to all a good nite||||reg||12
Z||000038||fierofreek2001||05-22-2001||12:23 AM||||if you guys go to these shows just to win trophies... then you are there for the wrong reasons... its meant to make friends, not enemies for gods sake.... i have a TON of respect for lisa, and i really admire her work, .. not to be sexist, but a girl? with a kick ass car that she did mostly herself? DAMN that deserves a lot of respect.. maybe instead of insults, you could LEARN from her... trophies arent everything, they are just by popular vote anyways... they mean something to whoever wins them cuz it shows their dedication and hardwork, but that doesnt mean that the losers didnt do the same, its just what other think and what they like that determines a trophy...  c'mon guys, dont pick fights<BR>steve<BR>p.s.   lisa can do any pose she wants on my car!!  woo hoo!||||reg||1
Z||000039||84Bill||05-22-2001||12:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierofreek2001:<BR><B>if you guys go to these shows just to win trophies... then you are there for the wrong reasons... its meant to make friends, not enemies for gods sake.... i have a TON of respect for lisa, and i really admire her work, .. not to be sexist, but a girl? with a kick ass car that she did mostly herself? DAMN that deserves a lot of respect.. maybe instead of insults, you could LEARN from her... trophies arent everything, they are just by popular vote anyways... they mean something to whoever wins them cuz it shows their dedication and hardwork, but that doesnt mean that the losers didnt do the same, its just what other think and what they like that determines a trophy...  c'mon guys, dont pick fights<BR>steve<BR>p.s.   lisa can do any pose she wants on my car!!  woo hoo!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well according to Lisa she was pissed because she could not compete last year. Hence "50 bucks for a stinkin trophy" So what does that say, Is she attending for the wrong reason? Humm lets think about whats going on here. <BR>I really truly dont care about flippin trophies hell I enter my car as a joke if anything! Well not really I enter it so I can be close to those that work so hard at making a car into something to admire. I won 3rd place at Englishtown and I was the only 84 in that CLASS!! was that an insult? I don't know but I laugh every time I walk past it and remember the day I met 4 really cool folks and rode down a highway with 3 other Fieros in a line. That is the real trophy. <BR>I met some of you folks at Carlisle and really enjoyed the day and I have a beer can to commerate the occasion sitting in the back of my car I was wondering how it would look affixed to the hood. Or sitting on the entertainment center next to the other trophy you get my meaning here? I really did get a trophy thow it was when Ski Veronica Flea and I walked around the grouds after almost everyone left. We walked passed the empy spots where all those nice cars were and I picked up one of the signs laying on the ground that said STOCK NOTCHBACK and get this if anyone even noticed Carlisle 1999. thats my trophy and I'm damn glad to have it! Even if it want even my class or in the same year. Well I think I've said enough. <P>Good night<BR> <IMG SRC="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/t1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/t2.jpg"> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000040||Taijiguy||05-22-2001||01:15 AM||||Well, it's sad there is this kind of disagreement. But, I guess when you have a community of over 2,000 people, they are occasionally going to clash. But, it's possible to disagree, and even be angry, but it doesn't mean you stop liking or respecting the person you're pissed at. You express yourself, and you move on. It would be a shame to lose any members as a result of a misunderstanding, or, what in my opinion, is just taking what is obviously a comment made out of some kind of frustration, and applying such literal implications to it. Looks like emotions took over, and some pretty ugly things were said. I hope there are some apologies being exchanged, there are some people here who deserve them.||||reg||1
Z||000041||JSocha||05-22-2001||01:17 AM||||Finally got to read the threads and get a bit caught up.<P>To me, it seemed if Lisa was only adding a bit of "sarcasim" to add a humorous twist in the fact that she worked hard for the win and nothing more to her comment then that, because her previous threads/posts all indicate how happy she was to receive the trophy.<P>That, IMO, does not reflect that she didn't appreciate it to which I see this thread as becoming more then an unnecessary bashing session.  We are all here to support the Fiero's exsistance, meet new friends and exchange ideas.  Lets do that and put the petty issues aside.<P>They were only words, nothing to get bent out of shape over if they were misconstrued in anyway.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
