Z||000043||KissMySSFiero||05-22-2001||06:33 AM||||Robert you said just what i was thinking.  I may have said the same thing.  i am goin to have my car at dell's.  IM NOT entering to win a "stinkin" trophy.  Hell those that have seen my car up close will tell i wont win a "stinkin" trophy.  Hell when i was in FL i got crap for nt having a spoiler on my Formula.  I didnt cry about it.  i put it back on.  its a fiero,  you know an ongoing process to get the damn thing right.  I hate to loose any members that have done the kind of work she has done on her car.  regardless if shes an attractive young lady or an old hairy-backed redneck with no teeth.  Anyone who brings conversation to the forum is apprectiated very much on here.  Anyways Im goin running before work.  dont go becuase of this,  its just not worth it.  <BR>George Carlin once said.  <BR>"Dont Sweat the Petty things, and dont pet sweaty things."<BR>its just not worth it. <P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>     <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>      <P>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">          <BR>"When in Doubt..Whip it out!!"||||reg||1
